From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheDBP <TheDBP@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 22:05:38 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] ether: let the gatekeeper and composer HALs read the
 properties they poll

gatekeeper reads a system_prop during startup; denied, it never registers IGatekeeper/default and
system_server blocks on getService() forever -- the boot animation plays indefinitely with no crash
and no reboot. The composer HAL polls the bootanim property; denied reads spin at several hundred
per second for the whole hang.
---
 sepolicy/hal_gatekeeper_default.te        | 4 ++++
 sepolicy/hal_graphics_composer_default.te | 3 +++
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 sepolicy/hal_gatekeeper_default.te
 create mode 100644 sepolicy/hal_graphics_composer_default.te

diff --git a/sepolicy/hal_gatekeeper_default.te b/sepolicy/hal_gatekeeper_default.te
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..82ed904
--- /dev/null
+++ b/sepolicy/hal_gatekeeper_default.te
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+# The gatekeeper HAL reads a system_prop-typed property during startup. Without this the read is
+# denied, the HAL never registers IGatekeeper/default, and system_server blocks on getService()
+# forever -- the boot animation plays indefinitely with no crash and no reboot.
+get_prop(hal_gatekeeper_default, system_prop);
diff --git a/sepolicy/hal_graphics_composer_default.te b/sepolicy/hal_graphics_composer_default.te
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..db7d574
--- /dev/null
+++ b/sepolicy/hal_graphics_composer_default.te
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# The composer HAL polls the boot animation property; denied reads spin at several hundred per
+# second and keep the CPU busy for the whole hang.
+get_prop(hal_graphics_composer_default, bootanim_system_prop);
